{
"id": 3959,
"iid": 6,
"project_id": 4572,
"title": "improve config file",
"description": "# Issue\n* Current configuration file is not well documented\n* The config class is not portable and not optimized\n* The default values documented in the wiki could/should be put in the config file\n* The location of the config file should follow convention : /etc/pcf.conf and/or ~/.pcf.conf, it should be found without the command-line parameter which should be optional\n\n# Solution\n* Define a new configuration file format (e.g. YAML)\n* Implement DRY pattern to not have a big config file per NF",
